## 4. Artifact Version Control & State Branching

### 4.1 The Version Tree Architecture
Figure 04.04 illustrates the branching tree architecture that tracks artifact iterations across a project lifecycle.

![Figure 04.04: Iterative Version History & Branching Tree](../assets/svg/diag_ch04_artifact_version_control.svg)

Every modification to an artifact creates a cryptographically hashed snapshot in the project version tree:
- **One-Click Rollback**: Users can inspect previous versions and instantly restore an earlier working state.
- **State Reconciliation**: Merging experimental branches back into the main artifact canvas without losing intervening conversational context.

